  "contentHtml": "<p>일기도 수업준비를 준비하면서&#160;10년도 전에 사용했던 외장하드를 오랫만에 꺼내서 자료를 찾아봤어요.&#160;</p><p>실로 오랫만의 김동완 기상캐스터와 유재석, 하하의 옛날 모습을 볼 수 있네요..</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그런데 이때는 저작권이 없던 시대라...</p><p>(아마 이 자료도 재과만에서 얻었던 것 같아요)&#160;</p><p>영상을 공유하고자 올려봅니다.&#160;</p><p>혹시 이것도 저작권에 걸릴려나요??&#160; 알려주시면 지울께요..</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvgauab8jg7na5owjq1mrxmo1@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvgauab8jg7na5owjq1mrxmo1%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33175146388%26signature%3Dk2abRYVharrsbCmm2J0YzpVbr2Q%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvgauab8jg7na5owjq1mrxmo1?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2Z2F1YWI4amc3bmE1b3dqcTFtcnhtbzEiLCJ0aWQiOiIxN2ZhMzEyNC02ZDRkLTRjYzYtYTc1Ni00MWNkZmE3NjZkZWIiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODU5OTV9.H6QX-8DcQWbT8iWY8MBVXEgEAR1ITDsoHIIQfyxaSJgEJURApXbhaxnghN30j5oXcsvqaGGvtjcXWc3JhpxPew&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그리고 기상청 유튜뷰도 좋은 것 같아요.&#160;<a href=\"http://&lt;iframe width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;315&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ir6w0qSdRD4&quot; title=&quot;YouTube video player&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allow=&quot;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture&quot; allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe